{"id":"0134626c9734e3cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Inner Iteration Strategy","display":"df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner Iteration Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner Iteration Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy — ZFC Inner Iteration Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0fdff2d00a515f5\" href=\"?note=b0fdff2d00a515f5\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (premouse)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> (iteration-length bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\\)</span> (domain of limit-length iteration trees defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (strategy function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> (candidate cofinal branch through an iteration tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\)</span> (iteration-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S\\)</span> (branch predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b0fdff2d00a515f5\" href=\"?note=b0fdff2d00a515f5\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrd}\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> (well-founded-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S\\)</span> (well-founded branch predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\">\\(\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\mathcal T:\\exists\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\lambda))\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\mathcal T:\\exists\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;(\\mathrm{LimitOrd}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\lambda))\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(\\in^{M_b^{\\mathcal T}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}branch} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{WF}(\\in^{M_b^{\\mathcal T}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Sigma))\\land\\forall\\mathcal T\\in\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\\;\\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S(\\Sigma(\\mathcal T),\\mathcal T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta},\\operatorname{ran}(\\Sigma))\\land\\forall\\mathcal T\\in\\mathcal D_{M,\\theta}\\;\\mathrm{WellFoundedIterationBranch}_S(\\Sigma(\\mathcal T),\\mathcal T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A strategy acts at limit stages and must select a cofinal branch whose branch model is well-founded; choosing an arbitrary branch through every successor-length tree is not sufficient.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"b0fdff2d00a515f5","anchor":"ref